【0】Suggest Treatment For Rapid Heart Beats
**Question**: Question: I'm having rapid heart beat for about five minutes now. no dizziness ; 

【1】**Answer**: Brief Answer:I would advise as follows:Detailed Answer:Hello!Welcome on HCM!Regarding your concernI would recommend to try resting in a quiet place, sitted or on a flat position for a while, drinking some fresh fluids (avoid cafeinated drinks) and measuring your blood pressure. If your racing heart rate doesn't calm down and keeps persisting; especially in the case of low blood pressure, I recommend asking medical assistance to the nearest ER service for a resting ECG, additional blood tests and an intravenous hydration if necessary.In case of any further uncertainties, feel free to ask me again.删除1:<u>Kind regards,Dr. Iliri</u>
